{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:27:10.675Z","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","content":"I want a full converstion on terminology - but on the pages that need settings information, use real labels, such as provider, model, and so forth.\nThe UI/UX should convey the metaphor and be consistent and holistic, but the details that need industry names should stay plain - they will likely be hidden on pages not used often anyway."}
{"parentUuid":"6ee2bcee-d415-4703-94eb-a5954e5250cb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01YaX2Rx99UUJQg43S4XNBam","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"55d0b77b-946e-4fcd-9dda-acc5a032e8b5","timestamp":"2026-11-12T22:27:21.867Z","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
