{"parentUuid":"55d0b77b-946e-4fcd-9dda-acc5a032e8b5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgypbK8PYgDJJk63FsdkD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two more pieces are pushed (`068e3b6..86b305f`). Full CI passes on each: 330 tests, clippy, seams, and the safeguard.\n\n- **66c598a: everything pressable lifts, and a job is a journey.**\n  - Every one of the app's 69 buttons now grows about 4% under the pointer. That's done by one `Lift` wrapper plus `lift::button`, and needed iced's `advanced` feature.\n  - The safeguard flagged `lift.rs` for argument count. Those signatures are fixed by iced's `Widget` trait, so I exempted it the same way as the canvas files.\n  - The job's chart is now titled \"THE JOURNEY\", and the Map calls workflows \"trails every job journeys along\".\n  - I couldn't see the hover myself, because the test tool puts the real pointer back after each click. Please move your pointer over a tab to check it.\n- **86b305f: each harbor town opens its atlas.** On the Map, hovering a workspace's town says \"press to read its atlas\". Pressing it opens a card over the chart with that workspace's field notes, sorted into \"About the workspace\" and \"About Bastion\". Each note shows who signed it, the request, whether the journey landed, and when. I checked it on demo-gh: the test note shows.\n\n**Left in the exploration plan:**\n1. **Route wear on the Map:** where recent journeys on each trail wait, turn back, or end in the marsh. The job list needs a `workflow` field from the server for this.\n2. **Learning from notes:** a note about Bastion offers \"make this a check\" or \"add this as guidance\" at the step it came from. That's how the app improves itself.\n3. **A legend** on each chart that explains its marks.\n\n8.0Gi of disk is free. Say continue and I'll start on route wear."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":765353,"output_tokens":592,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":592,"cache_read_input_tokens":765353,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.43.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.49.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.51.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.53.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.57.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.59.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.67.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.72.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.75.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.77.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.84.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.87.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.90.content.0","reas